    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22960,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and rapid growth, the industry has devolved into a \ncommoditized race to the bottom. But just because  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28560,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the big corporations are losing money doesn't mean \neveryone else is. While they're all hemorrhaging  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33600,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cash, the local self-funded dispensaries are \nquietly surviving. For them, profit isn't a future  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39440,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goal, it's a mandate. California is the world's \nlargest and most competitive cannabis market. In  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45600,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2023, $5.1 billion of legal cannabis was sold in \nthe Golden State with another $8 billion moving  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52400,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the black market. Los Angeles County alone \nreigns as the highest grossing market with five  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58720,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 10 times as many sales as any other county \nin the state. There are more dispensaries and  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63920,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "black market dealers in LA County than in most \nstates combined. But if you can make it here,  "
    } ]
  }, {
